# AI Internship Hunter & Multi-Agent Resume Refinery

Follow the master skill runbook at:
.agents/skills/internship-hunter/SKILL.md

Key Rules:
1. Always adhere to .agents/rules/resume_integrity.md (never hallucinate skills, metrics, or experiences).
2. For resume compilation, use .agents/skills/internship-hunter/tools/compile_resume.sh to enforce strict 1-page budget.
3. For Google Sheets deduplication and logging, use .agents/skills/internship-hunter/tools/sheets_sync.py.
4. For the 3-stage tailoring loop, consult the prompts in .agents/skills/internship-hunter/prompts/.
